    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "c2023c00239.pdf, p.13";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15b-ss-1-norm>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15b-ss-1-norm> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/Obligation>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/partOf> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15b-ss-1>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/borneBy> <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/LegalPerson>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "borne by: LegalPerson";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/deonticStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/HeuristicDerived>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15b-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15b-ss-1-logic-deontic-1>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15b-ss-1-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "is";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Definition of a mortgage broker";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A licensee is a mortgage broker if:  (a) the licensee carries on a business of providing credit assistance in relation to credit contracts secured by mortgages over residential property; and  (b) the licensee does not perform the obligations, or exercise the rights, of a credit provider in relation to the majority of those credit contracts; and  (c) in carrying on the business, the licensee provides credit assistance in relation to credit contracts offered by more than one credit provider.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) A licensee is a mortgage broker if:  (a) the licensee carries on a business of providing credit assistance in relation to credit contracts secured by mortgages over residential property; and  (b) the licensee does not perform the obligations, or exercise the rights, of a credit provider in relation to the majority of those credit contracts; and  (c) in carrying on the business, the licensee provides credit assistance in relation to credit contracts offered by more than one credit provider.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
